# The Gobbiebag Part I (jeuno 27) with its era module (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_SOA 0) against Lure of the Wildcat
# (Jeuno) (jeuno 90, C#) at Bluffnix. At fame level 1 (a fresh char, the inventory 30) the module's state 3 answers 42
# (31), an Event: Lure's 10056 (bit 12 unset), a Progress event, wins (no tie); a GM clears Lure's Prog: 10056 again;
# with bit 12 set, 42 (31) alone. At fame level 3 (a GM) the module's state 1 answers 43 (31, 0, 1), a Progress event:
# with Lure's Prog cleared the two tie, no last event (no tie played before): 10056 (the container order); the next
# talk, the last 10056: 43, begun.
module modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/the_gobbiebag_part_1_to_10.lua
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/42 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10056
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
quest Jeuno.LureOfTheWildcat accepted
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # state 3's 42 (31), an Event; 10056, a Progress event: 10056
finish                                  # bit 12
charvar Quest[3][90]Prog 0              # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # 10056 again (a Progress event over an Event: no tie)
finish                                  # bit 12
trigger Bluffnix                        # bit 12 set: state 3's 42 (31) alone
finish
fame Sandoria 250                       # a GM: fame level 3
charvar Quest[3][90]Prog 0              # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # the module's state 1 43 (31, 0, 1) ties with 10056, no last event: 10056
finish                                  # bit 12
charvar Quest[3][90]Prog 0              # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # the tie, the last 10056: 43 (31, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
